  <item>
    <title><![CDATA[Override Post Links]]></title>
    <dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
    <content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Three of these posts have a <strong>News Link</strong> set in the post editor sidebar. Their title, featured image and Read more link point to the external URL and open in a new tab, and the News Link Source paragraph shows the source name. The other posts link to their own pages as usual.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

